Oath's restic has no Azure, Backblaze, Google Cloud or Swift backend: each pulls in a
cloud SDK, and together they are 48 of its 85 modules, gRPC and OpenTelemetry among
them (R57). Local, SFTP, REST, S3 and rclone stay.

